#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:103
msgid ""
"Thresholds are numeric rather than a list of approved CPU and GPU models, so"
" equivalent hardware passes. CPU single-thread throughput is weighted most "
"heavily and is measured with a short benchmark rather than inferred from the"
" core count: Pink IK and CPU-side physics are single-thread bound, so a "
"machine with fewer but faster cores teleoperates better than one with many "
"slow cores."
msgstr ""
"检查使用数值阈值，而不是认可的 CPU 和 GPU 型号列表，因此同等级硬件也能通过。CPU "
"单线程吞吐量的权重最高，通过短时基准测试测量，而不是根据核心数推断。Pink IK 和 CPU "
"侧物理受单线程性能限制，因此核心较少但单核更快的机器，遥操作表现会优于拥有许多较慢核心的机器。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:111
msgid ""
"**The CPU governor is only reported when the machine is also measurably "
"slow.** Ubuntu defaults to ``powersave``, which costs per-frame ramp-up "
"latency in the bursty workload teleoperation generates. The governor is a "
"proxy for delivered throughput, though, so a workstation whose single-thread"
" score already meets its threshold is fast enough whatever the governor says"
" and is not flagged. Setting ``performance`` remains a setup step -- see "
":ref:`install-isaac-teleop`."
msgstr ""
"**只有机器实测速度也较慢时，才会报告 CPU 频率调节策略问题。** Ubuntu 默认采用 ``powersave`` "
"，在遥操作这种突发性负载下，会增加每帧的升频延迟。不过，调节策略只是实际吞吐量的间接指标：如果工作站单线程得分已达到阈值，不论采用何种策略，都认为速度足够，不会标记问题。配置时仍建议设置"
" ``performance`` ，参见 :ref:`install-isaac-teleop` 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:118
msgid ""
"If a probe is unavailable (for example, ``cpufreq`` is not exposed inside a "
"container), that item is reported as skipped rather than failed."
msgstr "如果某项探测不可用，例如容器内未暴露 ``cpufreq`` ，则报告该项已跳过，而非失败。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:121
msgid ""
"On a multi-GPU workstation the GPU checks measure the device the session "
"runs on -- the one selected with ``--device`` -- not simply the first "
"adapter. The reported value names the ordinal (e.g. ``cuda:1``) so it is "
"clear which GPU was measured."
msgstr ""
"多 GPU 工作站的 GPU 检查针对会话实际使用的设备，即 ``--device`` 选择的设备，而非简单检查第一块显卡。报告值会注明设备序号，例如 "
"``cuda:1`` ，以明确测量的是哪块 GPU。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:125
msgid ""
"To use the check on its own -- for example to qualify a machine before "
"setting up a session:"
msgstr "也可以单独运行检查，例如在配置会话前评估机器："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:135
msgid "Install Isaac Capture"
msgstr "安装 Isaac Capture"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:137
msgid ""
"Use this path to teleoperate robots from an XR headset and to record "
"demonstrations for imitation learning. It uses the ``teleop`` extra, which "
"carries `Isaac Capture <https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`__ with its "
"CloudXR streaming runtime, and Isaac Sim itself for the Kit XR runtime that "
"renders the stereo view. One flag covers the whole workflow."
msgstr ""
"通过此方式，可以从 XR 头显遥操作机器人，并录制用于模仿学习的示范。它使用 ``teleop`` 可选依赖组，其中包含 `Isaac Capture "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`__ 及其 CloudXR 串流运行时，也包含 Isaac "
"Sim，用于渲染双目视图的 Kit XR 运行时。一个选项即可覆盖整个工作流。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:143
msgid ""
"XR teleoperation is supported on **Linux x86_64 only**. The ``teleop`` extra"
" gates ``isaacteleop`` and ``dex-retargeting`` behind platform markers, so "
"on Windows or aarch64 the extra resolves but installs nothing usable. It is "
"also not supported on DGX Spark."
msgstr ""
"XR 遥操作 **只支持 Linux x86_64** 。 ``teleop`` 可选依赖组通过平台标记限制 ``isaacteleop`` 和 "
"``dex-retargeting`` ；因此在 Windows 或 aarch64 上，依赖组虽然能解析，却不会安装可用组件。DGX Spark "
"也不受支持。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:147
msgid ""
"``isaaclab teleop`` groups the three workflow scripts: ``run`` for a live "
"session, ``record`` to capture demonstrations, and ``replay`` to play a "
"dataset back. :ref:`The next section <run-isaac-lab-with-the-cloudxr-"
"runtime>` walks through a session once setup is complete."
msgstr ""
"``isaaclab teleop`` 将三个工作流脚本组织在一起： ``run`` 用于实时会话， ``record`` 用于录制示范， "
"``replay`` 用于回放数据集。完成配置后， :ref:`下一节 <run-isaac-lab-with-the-cloudxr-"
"runtime>` 会介绍如何运行会话。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:153
msgid ""
"``teleop`` cannot be combined with ``ov`` or ``ovphysx`` in a single ``uv "
"run``: the bundled Isaac Sim pins ``packaging==26.0`` while those runtimes "
"require ``<24``. Install the OV runtimes separately when you need them."
msgstr ""
"不能在同一条 ``uv run`` 命令中同时选择 ``teleop`` 和 ``ov`` 或 ``ovphysx`` ：随附的 Isaac Sim "
"锁定 ``packaging==26.0`` ，而这些运行时要求 ``<24`` 。需要 OV 运行时时，应单独安装。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:157
msgid "Complete these steps first:"
msgstr "先完成以下步骤："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:159
msgid "Install the system libraries required by the CloudXR runtime:"
msgstr "安装 CloudXR 运行时所需的系统库："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:165
msgid ""
"The CloudXR runtime links against Vulkan at runtime. If your system already "
"has the NVIDIA driver installed, ``libvulkan1`` may already be present."
msgstr "CloudXR 运行时在运行时链接 Vulkan。如果系统已安装 NVIDIA 驱动， ``libvulkan1`` 可能已经存在。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:168
msgid "Set the CPU frequency governor to ``performance``:"
msgstr "将 CPU 频率调节策略设为 ``performance`` ："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:177
msgid ""
"Ubuntu defaults to the ``powersave`` governor, which measurably increases "
"Pink IK solve latency and lowers the achievable teleop frame rate. Because "
"IK and CPU-side physics are single-thread bound, this is one of the highest-"
"impact settings on the workstation."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu 默认的 ``powersave`` 策略会明显增加 Pink IK 求解延迟，降低可达到的遥操作帧率。由于 IK 和 CPU "
"侧物理受单线程性能限制，这是工作站上影响较大的设置之一。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:181
msgid "Verify the change:"
msgstr "验证修改："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:187
msgid "Expected output: ``performance``."
msgstr "预期输出： ``performance`` 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:191
msgid ""
"This setting does not survive a reboot. Re-run the command after restarting,"
" or make it persistent with a systemd unit or your distribution's "
"``cpupower`` service configuration. The :ref:`teleop-workstation-capability-"
"check` reports the governor at session start, so a machine that has reverted"
" to ``powersave`` is flagged before you notice the frame rate."
msgstr ""
"此设置在重启后失效。重启后需再次运行命令，或通过 systemd 单元、发行版的 ``cpupower`` 服务配置使其持久生效。 "
":ref:`teleop-workstation-capability-check` 在会话启动时报告调节策略，因此机器恢复到 "
"``powersave`` 后，可以在注意到帧率下降前得到提示。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:196
msgid ""
"``isaacteleop`` ships as part of the ``teleop`` extra, so no separate pip "
"install step is required — but note that it comes from the extra rather than"
" from the ``isaaclab_teleop`` package metadata, so installing "
"``isaaclab_teleop`` on its own does **not** pull it in. For building from "
"source or plugin development, see the `Isaac Capture GitHub "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`_."
msgstr ""
"``isaacteleop`` 包含在 ``teleop`` 可选依赖组中，无需单独执行 pip 安装。但它来自该依赖组，而非 "
"``isaaclab_teleop`` 的包元数据，所以单独安装 ``isaaclab_teleop`` **不会** 安装它。源码构建或插件开发见 "
"`Isaac Capture GitHub <https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`_ 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:202
msgid ""
"Configure the firewall to allow CloudXR traffic. The required ports depend "
