msgstr "配置防火墙以允许 CloudXR 流量。所需端口取决于客户端类型。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:205
msgid "**For Apple native clients** (CloudXR Framework):"
msgstr "**Apple 原生客户端** （CloudXR Framework）："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:223
msgid "**For web clients** (CloudXR.js via the built-in WSS proxy):"
msgstr "**网页客户端** （通过内置 WSS 代理使用 CloudXR.js）："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:231
msgid ""
"For full network requirements and Windows firewall instructions, see the "
"`CloudXR Network Setup <https://docs.nvidia.com/cloudxr-"
"sdk/latest/requirement/network_setup.html#firewall-configuration>`__ "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"完整网络要求和 Windows 防火墙说明见 `CloudXR 网络配置 <https://docs.nvidia.com/cloudxr-"
"sdk/latest/requirement/network_setup.html#firewall-configuration>`__ 文档。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:239
msgid "Run Isaac Lab with CloudXR"
msgstr "配合 CloudXR 运行 Isaac Lab"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:241
msgid ""
"The CloudXR runtime launches automatically when a teleop script is started. "
"No separate terminal or ``source`` step is needed. Launch a teleoperation "
"session directly:"
msgstr "启动遥操作脚本时，CloudXR 运行时会自动启动，无需另开终端或执行 ``source`` 。直接启动遥操作会话："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:0
msgid "uv (Recommended)"
msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:0
msgid "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"
