#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:264
msgid ""
"To verify that the headset and controller tracking poses are reaching Isaac "
"Lab, add ``--enable_debug_visualization`` to the command. The visualization "
"draws red markers at tracked hand joints and RGB axes at tracked controller "
"aim poses. See :ref:`isaac-teleop-tracking-debug-visualization` for details."
msgstr ""
"要确认头显与控制器的跟踪位姿已传到 Isaac Lab，可在命令中添加 ``--enable_debug_visualization`` "
"。可视化会在跟踪到的手部关节位置绘制红色标记，并在控制器的指向位姿处绘制 RGB 坐标轴。详情见 :ref:`isaac-teleop-"
"tracking-debug-visualization` 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:269
msgid ""
"For fixed-base G1 upper-body manipulation, select ``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-"
"FixedBaseUpperBodyIK-G1-Abs`` instead. Both G1 tasks enable a head-locked "
"robot-camera PiP panel by default in XR. See :ref:`isaac-teleop-xr-camera-"
"feedback` for a fixed-base launch example, camera-recording differences, and"
" scene-partition isolation behavior."
msgstr ""
"固定基座 G1 上半身操作应改选 ``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-FixedBaseUpperBodyIK-G1-Abs`` 。两个 "
"G1 任务默认都在 XR 中启用随头部移动的机器人相机画中画面板。固定基座启动示例、相机录制差异和场景分区隔离行为见 :ref:`isaac-"
"teleop-xr-camera-feedback` 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:276
msgid ""
"**First run — EULA acceptance required.** On the first launch, Isaac Sim "
"will prompt you to accept the NVIDIA Omniverse License Agreement before the "
"simulation starts:"
msgstr "**首次运行需要接受 EULA。** 首次启动时，Isaac Sim 会在仿真开始前提示接受 NVIDIA Omniverse 许可协议："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:287
msgid ""
"Type ``Yes`` and press **Enter** to continue. If this prompt goes unnoticed "
"the script will appear to hang — check your terminal output if Isaac Sim "
"does not start within a few seconds."
msgstr ""
"输入 ``Yes`` 并按 **Enter** 继续。如果忽略了提示，脚本会看似卡住；若 Isaac Sim 几秒内未启动，请检查终端输出。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:293
msgid ""
"The ``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-Locomanipulation-G1-Abs`` task above uses "
"**motion controllers** as its input mode: the controller grip poses drive "
"the arms, the trigger and squeeze buttons close the TriHand fingers, and the"
" thumbsticks drive locomotion and hip height. Hold a controller in each hand"
" rather than relying on optical hand tracking. Other tasks expect hand "
"tracking instead -- see the :ref:`isaac-teleop-control-schemes` table for "
"the full list."
msgstr ""
"上述 ``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-Locomanipulation-G1-Abs`` 任务以 **运动控制器** "
"作为输入：控制器的握持位姿驱动双臂，扳机和握压按钮闭合 TriHand "
"手指，摇杆控制移动和髋部高度。应双手各持一个控制器，而不是依靠光学手部跟踪。其他任务则可能要求手部跟踪，完整列表见 :ref:`isaac-"
"teleop-control-schemes` 表。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:300
msgid ""
"To switch the CloudXR device profile at launch time (e.g. from Quest to "
"Apple Vision Pro), use the ``--cloudxr_env`` flag. Apple Vision Pro tracks "
"hands rather than motion controllers, so pair it with a hand-tracking task "
"such as ``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-GR1T2-WaistEnabled-Abs``:"
msgstr ""
"启动时可通过 ``--cloudxr_env`` 切换 CloudXR 设备配置，例如从 Quest 切换到 Apple Vision "
"Pro。Apple Vision Pro 跟踪双手而非运动控制器，因此应搭配手部跟踪任务，例如 ``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-"
"GR1T2-WaistEnabled-Abs`` ："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:327
msgid ""
"For details on the shipped ``.env`` profiles and how to customise them, see "
":ref:`isaac-teleop-cloudxr-profiles` in the feature guide."
msgstr "随附 ``.env`` 配置及其自定义方法，见功能指南中的 :ref:`isaac-teleop-cloudxr-profiles` 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:330
msgid "Then in the Isaac Sim UI:"
msgstr "然后在 Isaac Sim 界面中："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:332
msgid "Locate the panel named **XR** and choose the following options:"
msgstr "找到 **XR** 面板，选择以下选项："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:334
msgid "Selected Output Plugin: **OpenXR**"
msgstr "选择的输出插件: **OpenXR**"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:335
msgid "OpenXR Runtime: **System OpenXR Runtime**"
msgstr "OpenXR 运行时: **System OpenXR Runtime**"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:337
msgid "Isaac Sim UI: XR Panel"
msgstr "Isaac Sim 界面：XR 面板"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:342
msgid "Click **Start XR**."
msgstr "点击 **Start XR** 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:344
msgid ""
"You should see \"Waiting for connection\" displayed in the status bar at the"
" bottom of the viewport. The dual-eye stereo render only becomes active once"
" a headset connects and playback begins on the device."
msgstr "视口底部状态栏应显示 \"Waiting for connection\"（等待连接）。只有头显连接并开始在设备上播放后，双目立体渲染才会启用。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:347
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab viewport showing \"Waiting for connection\" status after clicking "
"Start XR"
msgstr "点击 Start XR 后，Isaac Lab 视口显示 \"Waiting for connection\" 状态。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:352
msgid "Isaac Lab is now ready to receive connections from a CloudXR client."
msgstr "Isaac Lab 已准备好接收 CloudXR 客户端连接。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:356
msgid ""
"**Running headless (no local UI).** The commands above use ``--visualizer "
"kit`` to open the local Kit viewport, where you click **Start XR**. On a "
"server or cloud instance without a display, run headless instead: omit "
"``--visualizer`` (headless is the default) or pass ``--visualizer none`` / "
"``--viz none``. In headless XR the AR session starts automatically -- there "
"is no viewport to click **Start XR** -- so Isaac Lab begins streaming as "
"soon as a CloudXR client connects. The ``--headless`` flag was removed in "
"Isaac Lab 3.0; ``HEADLESS=1`` in the environment also forces headless."
msgstr ""
"**无界面运行（没有本地图形界面）。** 上述命令使用 ``--visualizer kit`` 打开本地 Kit 视口，需要点击 **Start "
"XR** 。在没有显示器的服务器或云实例上，应使用默认的无界面模式：省略 ``--visualizer`` ，或传入 ``--visualizer "
"none`` / ``--viz none`` 。无界面 XR 中，AR 会话自动启动，无需在视口点击 **Start XR** ；CloudXR "
"客户端一连接，Isaac Lab 就开始串流。Isaac Lab 3.0 已移除 ``--headless`` 标志；设置环境变量 "
"``HEADLESS=1`` 也可强制无界面运行。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:366
msgid ""
"**ERROR_STREAMSDK_PORT_UNAVAILABLE / port 49100 already in use.** The "
"CloudXR runtime binds TCP port 49100 for WebRTC signaling. If a previous "
"CloudXR runtime instance is still running, ``Server::create`` fails with "
"this error. Identify the process holding the port, confirm it is safe to "
"stop, then terminate it -- try a graceful ``kill`` before escalating to "
"``kill -9``:"
msgstr ""
"**ERROR_STREAMSDK_PORT_UNAVAILABLE / 49100 端口已被占用。** CloudXR 运行时绑定 TCP 49100"
" 端口进行 WebRTC 信令通信。如果之前的 CloudXR 实例仍在运行， ``Server::create`` "
"会因这一错误失败。查明占用端口的进程，确认可以停止后再终止它；先尝试正常的 ``kill`` ，必要时再用 ``kill -9`` ："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:378
msgid ""
"Alternatively, set a different port with the ``NV_CXR_SERVER_PORT`` "
"environment variable."
msgstr "也可通过 ``NV_CXR_SERVER_PORT`` 环境变量设置其他端口。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:384
msgid "Connect an XR Device"
msgstr "连接 XR 设备"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:386
msgid ""
"Isaac Capture supports several XR headsets. You only need **one** of the "
"devices below -- choose the tab that matches your hardware."
msgstr "Isaac Capture 支持多种 XR 头显。只需下列设备中的 **一种** ，选择与你的硬件对应的选项卡。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:0
msgid "Meta Quest 3 / Pico 4 Ultra"
msgstr "Meta Quest 3 / Pico 4 Ultra"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:396
msgid ""
"Meta Quest 3 and Pico 4 Ultra connect to Isaac Lab via the `CloudXR.js "
"<https://docs.nvidia.com/cloudxr-"
"sdk/latest/usr_guide/cloudxr_js/index.html>`_ WebXR client. The built-in "
"environments default to the ``cloudxrjs-cloudxr.env`` profile (``auto-"
"webrtc``), which is the correct setting for these devices."
msgstr ""
"Meta Quest 3 和 Pico 4 Ultra 通过 `CloudXR.js <https://docs.nvidia.com/cloudxr-"
"sdk/latest/usr_guide/cloudxr_js/index.html>`_ WebXR 客户端连接 Isaac Lab。内置环境默认采用"
" ``cloudxrjs-cloudxr.env`` 配置（ ``auto-webrtc`` ），这正是这些设备所需的设置。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:403
msgid ""
"Pico 4 Ultra requires Pico OS 15.4.4U or later and must use HTTPS mode."
msgstr "Pico 4 Ultra 需要 Pico OS 15.4.4U 或更新版本，且必须使用 HTTPS 模式。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:405
msgid ""
"Launch the teleop script as shown in :ref:`run-isaac-lab-with-the-cloudxr-"
"runtime`. The CloudXR runtime and WSS proxy start automatically."
msgstr ""
"按照 :ref:`run-isaac-lab-with-the-cloudxr-runtime` 启动遥操作脚本。CloudXR 运行时和 WSS "
"代理会自动启动。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:409
msgid ""
"Open the browser on your headset and navigate to the hosted CloudXR.js "
"client: `<https://nvidia.github.io/IsaacCapture/client/release-1.4.x/>`_."
msgstr ""
"在头显中打开浏览器，访问托管的 CloudXR.js 客户端： "
"`<https://nvidia.github.io/IsaacCapture/client/release-1.4.x/>`_ 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:414
msgid ""
"The web client URL is versioned. The ``release-1.4.x`` path corresponds to "
"the ``isaacteleop`` version pinned by Isaac Lab (``isaacteleop~=1.4.145`` in"
" the ``teleop`` extra of the root ``pyproject.toml``). When Isaac Lab "
"updates its teleoperation dependency, update this link to the matching "
"client release."
msgstr ""
"网页客户端 URL 带有版本。 ``release-1.4.x`` 路径对应 Isaac Lab 锁定的 ``isaacteleop`` 版本，即根 "
"``pyproject.toml`` 的 ``teleop`` 依赖组中的 ``isaacteleop~=1.4.145`` 。Isaac Lab "
"更新遥操作依赖时，应将此链接更新为匹配的客户端版本。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:421
msgid ""
"For rapid development, you can test the CloudXR.js client on a desktop "
"browser before deploying to headsets."
msgstr "开发时，可以先在桌面浏览器中测试 CloudXR.js 客户端，再部署到头显。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:424
msgid ""
"Enter the IP address of your Isaac Lab host machine in the **Server IP** "
"field."
msgstr "在 **Server IP** 字段中输入 Isaac Lab 主机的 IP 地址。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:426
msgid ""
"Because the WSS proxy uses a self-signed certificate, you must accept it "
"before connecting. Click the **Click https://<ip>:48322/ to accept cert** "
"link that appears on the page."
msgstr ""
"WSS 代理使用自签名证书，因此连接前必须接受它。点击页面上的 **Click https://<ip>:48322/ to accept cert**"
" 链接。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:430
msgid "CloudXR.js certificate acceptance link"
msgstr "CloudXR.js 证书接受链接"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:435
msgid ""
"A new tab opens with a **\"Your connection is not private\"** warning. Click"
" **Advanced**, then click **Proceed to <ip> (unsafe)**."
msgstr ""
"新选项卡会显示 **\"Your connection is not private\"** （连接不安全）警告。点击 **Advanced** "
"，再点击 **Proceed to <ip> (unsafe)** 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:438
msgid "Browser privacy warning for self-signed certificate"
msgstr "浏览器对自签名证书显示的隐私警告"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:443
msgid ""
"The browser will show a **\"Certificate Accepted\"** page confirming the "
"certificate has been accepted. Close this tab and return to the CloudXR.js "
"client page."
msgstr ""
"浏览器会显示 **\"Certificate Accepted\"** 页面，确认已接受证书。关闭该选项卡，返回 CloudXR.js 客户端页面。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:446
msgid "Certificate accepted confirmation page"
msgstr "证书已接受的确认页面"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:451
msgid "Click **Connect** to begin teleoperation."
msgstr "点击 **Connect** 开始遥操作。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:453
msgid ""
"For advanced configuration, troubleshooting, and additional details, see the"
" `CloudXR.js User Guide <https://docs.nvidia.com/cloudxr-"
"sdk/latest/usr_guide/cloudxr_js/index.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"高级配置、故障排查及更多信息见 `CloudXR.js 用户指南 <https://docs.nvidia.com/cloudxr-"
"sdk/latest/usr_guide/cloudxr_js/index.html>`_ 。"

