msgstr "IK 求解器失败时，头显中会出现错误消息。点击 **Reset** ，将机器人恢复到初始位姿，再继续操作。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:587
msgid "IK error message in XR device"
msgstr "XR 设备中的 IK 错误消息"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:592
msgid "Click **Disconnect** when finished."
msgstr "完成后点击 **Disconnect** 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:598
msgid "Manus Gloves"
msgstr "Manus 手套"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:600
msgid ""
"Manus gloves provide high-fidelity finger tracking via the Manus SDK. This "
"is useful when optical hand tracking from the headset is occluded or when "
"higher-precision finger data is needed. Because the gloves feed the hand-"
"tracking pipeline, pair them with a hand-tracking task such as "
"``IsaacContrib-PickPlace-GR1T2-WaistEnabled-Abs`` rather than a controller-"
"driven one. Manus tracking data flows through the same API as headset-based "
"optical hand tracking in Isaac Capture, so the same retargeters and "
"pipelines work with both input sources."
msgstr ""
"Manus 手套通过 Manus SDK "
"提供高保真手指跟踪，适用于头显光学手部跟踪被遮挡，或需要更高精度手指数据的情况。手套输入进入手部跟踪管线，因此应搭配 ``IsaacContrib-"
"PickPlace-GR1T2-WaistEnabled-Abs`` 等手部跟踪任务，而非控制器驱动任务。在 Isaac Capture 中，Manus"
" 跟踪数据与头显光学手部跟踪使用同一 API，因此二者可使用相同的重定向器和管线。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:609
msgid ""
"Manus glove support has been migrated into Isaac Capture as a native plugin."
" The previous ``isaac-teleop-device-plugins`` repository and the "
"``libsurvive``-based Vive tracker integration are no longer required."
msgstr ""
"Manus 手套支持已迁入 Isaac Capture，作为原生插件提供。以前的 ``isaac-teleop-device-plugins`` "
"仓库和基于 ``libsurvive`` 的 Vive 跟踪器集成已不再需要。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:616
msgid ""
"**Manus gloves with a Manus SDK license**, paired with the MANUS Core "
"application so they are connected and calibrated. See the `MANUS Getting "
"Started guide for Linux <https://docs.manus-"
"meta.com/3.1.1/Plugins/SDK/Linux/>`_."
msgstr ""
"**具有 Manus SDK 许可的 Manus 手套** ，已与 MANUS Core 应用配对、连接并完成校准。参见 `MANUS Linux "
"入门指南 <https://docs.manus-meta.com/3.1.1/Plugins/SDK/Linux/>`_ 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:620
msgid ""
"**The** ``manus_hand_plugin`` **plugin, built from Isaac Capture source**: "
"glove tracking data is streamed by a standalone C++ plugin that you run "
"alongside the sim."
msgstr ""
"**从 Isaac Capture 源码构建的** ``manus_hand_plugin`` **插件** ：手套跟踪数据由独立 C++ "
"插件传输，需要与仿真一同运行。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:625
msgid ""
"``manus_hand_plugin`` is **not** shipped with Isaac Lab, is **not** part of "
"the ``isaacteleop`` pip package, and is not in any release archive. It "
"exists only after building the `Isaac Capture "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`_ repository from source. If "
"``install/plugins/manus/manus_hand_plugin`` does not exist in your Isaac "
"Capture checkout, this step has not been completed."
msgstr ""
"``manus_hand_plugin`` **不随** Isaac Lab 提供，也 **不包含** 在 ``isaacteleop`` pip "
"包或任何发布归档中。只有从源码构建 `Isaac Capture <https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture>`_ "
"仓库后，它才会存在。如果 Isaac Capture 检出目录中没有 "
"``install/plugins/manus/manus_hand_plugin`` ，说明尚未完成这一步。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:631
msgid ""
"Clone the repository and check out the release branch matching the "
"``isaacteleop`` version Isaac Lab is pinned to (``isaacteleop~=1.4.145`` in "
"the ``teleop`` extra of the root ``pyproject.toml``), so the plugin's wire "
"format matches the ``isaacteleop`` package Isaac Lab installs:"
msgstr ""
"克隆仓库，并检出与 Isaac Lab 锁定的 ``isaacteleop`` 版本匹配的发布分支（根 ``pyproject.toml`` 的 "
"``teleop`` 依赖组目前锁定 ``isaacteleop~=1.4.145`` ），以确保插件的通信格式与 Isaac Lab 安装的 "
"``isaacteleop`` 包匹配："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:644
msgid ""
"When Isaac Lab updates its teleoperation dependency, check out the matching "
"``release/<version>.x`` branch instead."
msgstr "Isaac Lab 更新遥操作依赖时，应改为检出匹配的 ``release/<version>.x`` 分支。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:647
msgid ""
"Grant the host access to the Manus dongle **once, on the host machine**. Run"
" this outside any container -- udev rules are processed by ``systemd-"
"udevd``, which does not run inside Docker, so installing rules from a "
"container has no effect:"
msgstr ""
"**在宿主机上执行一次** ，授予主机访问 Manus 接收器的权限。不要在容器内执行：udev 规则由 ``systemd-udevd`` "
"处理，而该服务不在 Docker 内运行，因此在容器内安装规则不会生效："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:657
msgid ""
"Then, inside the environment you build in (devcontainer, Isaac ROS "
"container, or bare host), install ``clang-format-14`` -- a missing ``clang-"
"format-14`` is the most common cause of a failed build, because the root "
"``CMakeLists.txt`` enforces the format check by default on Linux and "
"``install_manus.sh`` does not install it for you:"
msgstr ""
"随后，在用于构建的环境中（开发容器、Isaac ROS 容器或宿主机）安装 ``clang-format-14`` "
"。缺少它是构建失败最常见的原因，因为根 ``CMakeLists.txt`` 默认在 Linux 上强制执行格式检查，而 "
"``install_manus.sh`` 不会帮你安装它："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:667
msgid "Then download the Manus SDK and build and install the plugin:"
msgstr "然后下载 Manus SDK，构建并安装插件："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:674
msgid ""
"The script installs the remaining required system packages, downloads the "
"Manus SDK, and builds and installs the plugin and its diagnostic CLI tool. "
"The plugin is installed to "
"``<IsaacCapture>/install/plugins/manus/manus_hand_plugin``. Every later "
"command in this section runs from the Isaac Capture checkout root; "
"substitute your own path for ``/path/to/IsaacCapture``."
msgstr ""
"脚本会安装其余必需系统包、下载 Manus SDK，并构建和安装插件及其诊断命令行工具。插件安装到 "
"``<IsaacCapture>/install/plugins/manus/manus_hand_plugin`` 。本节后续所有命令均从 Isaac"
" Capture 检出目录根部运行；请将 ``/path/to/IsaacCapture`` 替换为实际路径。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:679
msgid ""
"Verify the build and that the gloves are tracking with the diagnostic CLI "
"tool, which opens a **MANUS Data Visualizer** window showing the hand "
"skeleton. Only one process can hold the Manus SDK connection at a time, so "
"stop the CLI tool before starting the plugin:"
msgstr ""
"使用诊断命令行工具验证构建结果和手套跟踪状态。它会打开 **MANUS Data Visualizer** "
"窗口，显示手部骨架。同一时间只能有一个进程占用 Manus SDK 连接，因此启动插件前应停止该工具："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:688
msgid ""
"See the `Manus plugin documentation`_ for manual installation without "
"``install_manus.sh``, the full data-path reference (skeleton injection, "
"flex-sensor tensors, haptics), and troubleshooting."
msgstr ""
"不使用 ``install_manus.sh`` 的手动安装方式、完整数据路径参考（骨架注入、弯曲传感器张量、触觉反馈）及故障排查，见 `Manus "
"插件文档 <Manus plugin documentation_>`_ 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:692
msgid ""
"**A Meta Quest 3 or Pico 4 Ultra controller per hand**, required for wrist "
"positioning. Each MANUS glove has a Universal Mount on the back of the wrist"
" strap; clip the controller into it so the controller's grip pose drives "
"wrist placement while the glove tracks the fingers. See `Wrist Positioning "
"-- Controllers vs Optical Hand Tracking`_ in the Manus plugin documentation "
"for how the plugin selects between controller and optical wrist tracking."
msgstr ""
"**每只手配一个 Meta Quest 3 或 Pico 4 Ultra 控制器** ，用于确定手腕位置。每只 MANUS 手套的腕带背面都有 "
"Universal Mount；将控制器卡入其中，使控制器握持位姿驱动手腕位置，而手套跟踪手指。插件如何在控制器和光学手腕跟踪之间选择，见 Manus "
"插件文档中的 `手腕定位：控制器与光学手部跟踪 <Wrist Positioning -- Controllers vs Optical Hand "
"Tracking_>`_ 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:701
msgid ""
"Meta Quest 3 controller mounted on the left MANUS glove's Universal Mount"
msgstr "Meta Quest 3 控制器安装在左侧 MANUS 手套的 Universal Mount 上"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:706
msgid "Left glove"
msgstr "左手套"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:707
msgid ""
"Meta Quest 3 controller mounted on the right MANUS glove's Universal Mount"
msgstr "Meta Quest 3 控制器安装在右侧 MANUS 手套的 Universal Mount 上"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:712
msgid "Right glove"
msgstr "右手套"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:715
msgid "Run the simulation"
msgstr "运行仿真"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:717
msgid ""
"Launch a teleoperation session paired with a hand-tracking task, as shown in"
" :ref:`run-isaac-lab-with-the-cloudxr-runtime`:"
msgstr "按 :ref:`run-isaac-lab-with-the-cloudxr-runtime` 所示，选择手部跟踪任务启动遥操作会话："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:740
msgid ""
"Manus gloves and other external push-device peripherals require "
"``NV_CXR_ENABLE_PUSH_DEVICES=1``. The shipped ``.env`` profiles set this to "
"``0`` (optimised for headset optical hand tracking). Create a custom "
"``.env`` file with the value set to ``1`` and pass it via ``--cloudxr_env`` "
"instead of the plain command above:"
msgstr ""
"Manus 手套及其他外部推送设备需要 ``NV_CXR_ENABLE_PUSH_DEVICES=1`` 。随附 ``.env`` 配置将其设为 "
"``0`` ，针对头显光学手部跟踪优化。创建自定义 ``.env`` 文件，将此值设为 ``1`` ，再通过 ``--cloudxr_env`` "
"传入，替代上述普通命令："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:774
msgid ""
"See :ref:`isaac-teleop-cloudxr-profiles` for full details on customising "
"profiles."
msgstr "自定义配置的完整说明见 :ref:`isaac-teleop-cloudxr-profiles` 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:776
msgid ""
"Wait for **\"Waiting for connection\"** in the viewport status bar (or, "
"running headless, for the CloudXR runtime to finish starting) before "
"launching the plugin -- see :ref:`run-isaac-lab-with-the-cloudxr-runtime`."
msgstr ""
"启动插件前，等待视口状态栏显示 **\"Waiting for connection\"** ；无界面运行时，则等待 CloudXR "
"运行时完成启动。参见 :ref:`run-isaac-lab-with-the-cloudxr-runtime` 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:781
msgid "Start the plugin"
msgstr "启动插件"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:783
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab does not spawn the plugin for you. Once the sim is up and CloudXR "
"is waiting for a connection, in a **separate terminal**, source the "
"environment file the runtime writes on startup (this points the OpenXR "
"loader at CloudXR) and start the plugin:"
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 不会替你启动插件。仿真已启动且 CloudXR 正等待连接后，在 **另一个终端** 中，用 ``source`` "
"加载运行时启动时写出的环境文件（它将 OpenXR 加载器指向 CloudXR），再启动插件："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:793
msgid ""
"By default the plugin enables human hand injection, flex-sensor push, and "
"haptic read. Restrict datasets with ``--datasets=`` (comma-separated) -- see"
" the `Manus plugin documentation`_ for details on each data path:"
msgstr ""
"插件默认启用人手数据注入、弯曲传感器推送和触觉反馈读取。可用 ``--datasets=`` 限定数据集（以逗号分隔）；各数据路径详情见 `Manus "
"插件文档 <Manus plugin documentation_>`_ ："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:803
msgid "Start teleoperation"
msgstr "启动遥操作"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:805
msgid "Put on the Manus gloves and headset."
msgstr "戴上 Manus 手套和头显。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:806
msgid ""
"Connect the headset to Isaac Lab: for Meta Quest 3 / Pico 4 Ultra, follow "
"the :ref:`connection steps above <connect-quest-pico>`; for Apple Vision "
"Pro, follow :ref:`the Apple Vision Pro steps <use-apple-vision-pro>`. No "
"additional pairing step is required for the gloves once the headset is "
"connected -- Manus tracking data replaces the headset's own hand tracking on"
" the same OpenXR path."
msgstr ""
"将头显连接到 Isaac Lab：Meta Quest 3 / Pico 4 Ultra 按 :ref:`上述连接步骤 <connect-quest-"
"pico>` 操作，Apple Vision Pro 按 :ref:`Apple Vision Pro 步骤 <use-apple-vision-"
"pro>` 操作。头显连接后，手套无需额外配对；Manus 跟踪数据在同一 OpenXR 路径上替代头显自身的手部跟踪。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:811
msgid ""
"Send the start command from the headset (Meta Quest 3 / Pico 4 Ultra: the "
"CloudXR.js **Connect** button; Apple Vision Pro: the **Play** button in the "
"Isaac XR Teleop Sample Client)."
msgstr ""
"从头显发送启动命令：Meta Quest 3 / Pico 4 Ultra 使用 CloudXR.js 的 **Connect** 按钮；Apple "
"Vision Pro 使用 Isaac XR Teleop Sample Client 的 **Play** 按钮。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:815
msgid ""
"Move your hands and the simulated follower will mirror the glove-tracked "
"finger joints in real time."
msgstr "移动双手，仿真中的从动机器人会实时跟随手套跟踪到的手指关节。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:821
msgid "Haptikos Exoskeletons with Quest"
msgstr "配合 Quest 使用 Haptikos 外骨骼"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:823
msgid ""
"The `Haptikos plugin "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture/tree/release/1.4.x/src/plugins/haptikos>`_"
" combines controller wrist poses with exoskeleton finger tracking from the "
"Haptikos Core App and pushes hand joints into the OpenXR runtime. Isaac Lab "
"receives them through Isaac Capture's standard hand-tracking input, so no "
"Haptikos-specific Isaac Lab device is needed. The plugin supports Linux and "
"has been tested with Meta Quest headsets; other headsets with controllers "
"may also work."
msgstr ""
"`Haptikos 插件 "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture/tree/release/1.4.x/src/plugins/haptikos>`_"
" 将控制器手腕位姿与 Haptikos Core App 的外骨骼手指跟踪相结合，把手部关节推送到 OpenXR 运行时。Isaac Lab 通过 "
"Isaac Capture 的标准手部跟踪输入接收数据，因此无需 Haptikos 专用的 Isaac Lab 设备。该插件支持 Linux，已在 "
"Meta Quest 头显上测试；其他带控制器的头显也可能可用。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:831
msgid "Build the plugin"
msgstr "构建插件"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:833
msgid ""
"The Haptikos plugin is built from Isaac Capture source; it is not included "
"in Isaac Lab's ``teleop`` extra. Check out the release branch matching Isaac"
" Lab's ``isaacteleop`` pin (currently ``1.4.x``), obtain the `Haptikos "
"Robotics API <https://github.com/Haptikostech/HaptikosAPI>`_, and copy its "
"``HaptikosCpp_API_Shared`` directory into ``src/plugins/haptikos``. The C++ "
"API is required to build the tracking plugin, even if you do not use haptic "
"feedback. Follow the `plugin's setup instructions "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture/tree/release/1.4.x/src/plugins/haptikos>`_"
" for Haptikos account and licensing requirements."
msgstr ""
"Haptikos 插件需从 Isaac Capture 源码构建，不包含在 Isaac Lab 的 ``teleop`` 可选依赖组中。检出与 "
"Isaac Lab 锁定的 ``isaacteleop`` 版本匹配的发布分支（目前为 ``1.4.x`` ），获取 `Haptikos "
"Robotics API <https://github.com/Haptikostech/HaptikosAPI>`_ ，并将其 "
"``HaptikosCpp_API_Shared`` 目录复制到 ``src/plugins/haptikos`` "
"。即使不使用触觉反馈，构建跟踪插件也需要 C++ API。Haptikos 账号和许可要求见 `插件配置说明 "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA/IsaacCapture/tree/release/1.4.x/src/plugins/haptikos>`_"
" 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:851
msgid "Run Isaac Lab and the plugin"
msgstr "运行 Isaac Lab 与插件"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:853
msgid ""
"Attach a controller to each exoskeleton using the included mount. Calibrate "
"the exoskeleton forward direction against the headset, then keep the "
"Haptikos Core App, exoskeletons, and controllers active. Use the hand-"
"tracking task below."
msgstr ""
"使用随附支架，为每个外骨骼安装一个控制器。以头显为参照校准外骨骼前向方向，然后保持 Haptikos Core "
"App、外骨骼和控制器运行。使用下列手部跟踪任务。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:857
msgid ""
"Haptikos uses an external OpenXR push device. The shipped CloudXR profiles "
"disable push devices, so enable them in a custom profile before launching "
"Isaac Lab:"
msgstr ""
"Haptikos 使用外部 OpenXR 推送设备。随附 CloudXR 配置禁用推送设备，因此启动 Isaac Lab 前，应在自定义配置中启用："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:870
msgid ""
"Once CloudXR is waiting for a connection, open a separate terminal and start"
" the plugin with the runtime environment created by Isaac Lab:"
msgstr "CloudXR 开始等待连接后，另开终端，使用 Isaac Lab 创建的运行时环境启动插件："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:879
msgid ""
"Connect the Quest using :ref:`the Quest/Pico connection steps <connect-"
"quest-pico>`, then start teleoperation from the headset."
msgstr "按 :ref:`Quest/Pico 连接步骤 <connect-quest-pico>` 连接 Quest，再从头显开始遥操作。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:882
msgid "See :ref:`isaac-teleop-cloudxr-profiles` for more on custom profiles."
msgstr "自定义配置的更多信息见 :ref:`isaac-teleop-cloudxr-profiles` 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:886
msgid "Run with Docker"
msgstr "使用 Docker 运行"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:888
msgid ""
"Teleoperation runs in a **single container**. Build the image yourself and "
"run a single container. Do **not** use Docker Compose, which is a multi-"
"container setup as we had in Isaac Lab 2.x. All components run inside one "
"container with Isaac Lab in this release."
msgstr ""
"遥操作在 **单个容器** 中运行。自行构建镜像并运行一个容器。 **不要使用** Docker Compose；它采用 Isaac Lab 2.x "
"中曾使用的多容器配置。本版本所有组件与 Isaac Lab 一同运行在一个容器中。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:892
msgid ""
"The CloudXR runtime auto-launches when a teleop script is started, so no "
"separate runtime command is needed."
msgstr "启动遥操作脚本时，CloudXR 运行时会自动启动，无需单独执行运行时命令。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:897
msgid ""
"Recent Isaac Lab Docker images (3.0.0-beta2 and later) run as a **non-root**"
" user (uid/gid 1000). Persistent named volumes or host directories that were"
" created by an earlier root-based image are owned by ``root`` and are **not "
"writable** by the runtime user. The XR teleop workflow trips on this first, "
"because it writes the extension registry cache under the runtime home. The "
"failure looks like::"
msgstr ""
"较新的 Isaac Lab Docker 镜像（3.0.0-beta2 及以后）以 **非 root** 用户运行，uid/gid 为 1000。旧的 "
"root 镜像创建的持久命名卷或宿主机目录归 ``root`` 所有，运行时用户 **无法写入** 。XR "
"遥操作往往最先遇到此问题，因为它会在运行时主目录下写入扩展注册表缓存。故障通常如下::"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:905
msgid "followed by a cascade of extension-registry errors::"
msgstr "随后出现一系列扩展注册表错误::"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:909
msgid ""
"To fix it, make the persistent storage writable by uid/gid 1000 before "
"relaunching:"
msgstr "重新启动前，使 uid/gid 1000 能写入持久存储，即可修复："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:911
msgid "**Docker Compose:** recreate the named volumes, e.g."
msgstr "**Docker Compose：** 重新创建命名卷，例如："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:917
msgid ""
"See :ref:`deployment-docker` for details. To preserve cached data instead of"
" deleting it, ``chown`` the volume: ``docker run --rm -v docker_isaac-"
"data:/data alpine chown -R 1000:1000 /data``."
msgstr ""
"详情见 :ref:`deployment-docker` 。如果希望保留缓存数据而非删除，可修改卷的所有权： ``docker run --rm -v "
"docker_isaac-data:/data alpine chown -R 1000:1000 /data`` 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:920
msgid ""
"**Single container with bind mounts:** pre-create the host directories and "
"``sudo chown -R 1000:1000`` them before launching, so the non-root user can "
"write to them."
msgstr ""
"**使用绑定挂载的单个容器：** 启动前创建宿主机目录，并执行 ``sudo chown -R 1000:1000`` ，使非 root 用户可写入。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:924
msgid ""
"Because the Isaac Lab container runs with ``network_mode: host``, the "
"container's ports are exposed directly on the host network stack. The host "
"firewall therefore governs whether XR devices can reach Isaac Lab. Apply the"
" same ``ufw`` rules from :ref:`install-isaac-teleop` **on the host machine**"
" before starting the container:"
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 容器采用 ``network_mode: host`` ，其端口直接暴露在宿主机网络栈上。因此，XR 设备能否访问 Isaac "
"Lab 由宿主机防火墙决定。启动容器前，在 **宿主机上** 应用 :ref:`install-isaac-teleop` 中相同的 ``ufw`` "
"规则："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:0
msgid "Meta Quest 3 / Pico 4 Ultra (web client)"
msgstr "Meta Quest 3 / Pico 4 Ultra（网页客户端）"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:0
msgid "Apple Vision Pro (native client)"
msgstr "Apple Vision Pro（原生客户端）"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:955
msgid ""
"If port 48322 is not open, the headset browser will show **\"This site can't"
" be reached\"** when navigating to the certificate-acceptance page — the TCP"
" connection fails before any certificate exchange occurs."
msgstr ""
"如果未开放 48322 端口，头显浏览器访问证书接受页面时，会显示 **\"This site can't be reached\"** "
"（无法访问此网站）。此时 TCP 连接在证书交换开始前就已失败。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:959
msgid ""
"Run the teleop script (e.g. ``record_demos.py`` to record demonstrations):"
msgstr "运行遥操作脚本，例如用 ``record_demos.py`` 录制示范："

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:983
msgid ""
"Then in the Isaac Sim UI, set the XR panel to **System OpenXR Runtime** and "
"click **Start XR**."
msgstr ""
"然后，在 Isaac Sim 界面中，将 XR 面板设为 **System OpenXR Runtime** ，并点击 **Start XR** 。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:985
msgid ""
"For a fully headless experience, replace ``--visualizer kit`` with "
"``--visualizer none`` or ``--viz none`` and the XR teleop session will run "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"如需完全无界面运行，将 ``--visualizer kit`` 换为 ``--visualizer none`` 或 ``--viz none`` "
"，XR 遥操作会话便会自动运行。"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:988
msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

#: source/how-to/cloudxr_teleoperation.rst:990
msgid ""
"**Architecture, retargeting, and control schemes**: :ref:`isaac-teleop-"
"feature`"
msgstr "**架构、重定向与控制方案** ： :ref:`isaac-teleop-feature`"

